nina: I'll push a small formatting fix and a 1-line migration note: "If you previously used unlimited retries, switch to bounded retries + deterministic trimming + fallback to avoid cascading rate limits."

rahul: One more: mention header names we set—`X-RateLimit-Limit` and `X-RateLimit-Remaining` (and Retry-After) so users can make smarter backoff. Also advise exponential backoff with jitter.

tasha: Perfect. Nina, can you include a tiny unit test that verifies TrimHistory keeps system prompt and last two turns? If yes, we can merge after CI passes.

nina: Yes, adding test now and fixing fences. Will ping when green.

